###>------------------------------------------------------------
# Keeps local developer's changes from ending up in the repo.
**/.gitignore

###>------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep from including these things commonly created during development process....
**/*.iml
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.rej
**/*.tmp

###>------------------------------------------------------------
# Allow for developers to "indicate" something they want ignored.
**/*.ignore
**/*.orig
**/*.test

###>------------------------------------------------------------
# OS Flotsam that are randomly left in the workspace.
# Chaff from OSs
**/.DS_Store
**/._.*
**/._*
**/Thumbs.db

###>------------------------------------------------------------
# Other sawdust that some utilites and things may leave behind.
**/*~

###>------------------------------------------------------------
# Project specific items.

*.pyc
*.swo
*.swp

/build
/dist
/csvkit.egg-info

/docs/_build
/man/.doctrees
